	shape: "gear",
	text: [
		"§6Aspectrus Seeds§r are strange plants that grow §6fruits§r which can be §6ground§r or §6cooked§r down into §6aspects§r.",
		"",
		"In order for aspectrus seeds, §6several conditions§r need to be met:",
		"",
		"They can only be planted on §6up to 3 blocks§r tall §6fences§r made out of §6Rubber Tree§r that are placed onto §6composted§r dirt/grass.",
		"",
		"The fences can §6not§r have any §6horizontal§r connections to other fences or blocks. ",
		"",
		"Once they are planted, a nearby §6Censer§r needs to be burning a §6vial§r of the specific §6aspect§r the fruits should adapt. ",
		"",
		"The §6amount§r of aspects in the vial only determines for how §6long§r the aspect mist lasts. ",
		"It does not affect the amount of aspects the fruit will contain in the end.",
		"",
		"Once the fruit has been §6fully grown§r, indicated by it's glowing §6light§r, it can be harvested."
	],
